{"3782570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystery of Prophecy", "steam_appid": 3782570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4828790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery of Prophecy</strong> is a pixel art Metroidvania based on biblical prophecies, health, and parkour. Developed by KeizhGd using the Game Maker Studio engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Nicós</strong>, a young man nearing his investiture as an explorer. After falling unconscious in the forest, he wakes up several days later weakened, overweight, and with his skills lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring his village, he accidentally activates an ancient machine that triggers an earthquake. His younger brother, <strong>Kokkí</strong>, falls into a pit along with a mysterious creature. From there, Nicós embarks on a journey to follow his brother’s trail through abandoned mines and dark passageways, uncovering a hidden past that the adults had kept secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you’ll learn about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biblical numerology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient prophecies and future events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour techniques and movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The impact of physical health on your abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a unique blend of exploration, combat, spiritual learning, and platforming, with a strong narrative focus and a retro visual style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery of Prophecy</strong> is a pixel art Metroidvania based on biblical prophecies, health, and parkour. Developed by KeizhGd using the Game Maker Studio engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Nicós</strong>, a young man nearing his investiture as an explorer. After falling unconscious in the forest, he wakes up several days later weakened, overweight, and with his skills lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring his village, he accidentally activates an ancient machine that triggers an earthquake. His younger brother, <strong>Kokkí</strong>, falls into a pit along with a mysterious creature. From there, Nicós embarks on a journey to follow his brother’s trail through abandoned mines and dark passageways, uncovering a hidden past that the adults had kept secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you’ll learn about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biblical numerology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient prophecies and future events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour techniques and movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The impact of physical health on your abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a unique blend of exploration, combat, spiritual learning, and platforming, with a strong narrative focus and a retro visual style.</p>", "short_description": "Mystery of Prophecy is a pixel art Metroidvania based on biblical prophecies, health, and parkour.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782570/6d17ab993d25df0f75e2d78e489076a4d4c5ace8/header.jpg?t=1785877310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782570/fadc11f7745470007ed38385cbd74396d9c3f874/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785877310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782570/fadc11f7745470007ed38385cbd74396d9c3f874/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785877310", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>M